{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836960",
      "title": "Transforming Fetched Data",
      "sourceHash": "070724c26b2a7b4614fb0bd7310d386a06607c25a0f6220e2257032e6c9bf538",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "So now that we're successfully",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 5.01,
          "en": "fetching the places here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.01,
          "end": 8.82,
          "en": "there's one additional thing I wanna do to that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.82,
          "end": 13.323,
          "en": "before I set those places as my available places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "Because in this application I actually also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 22.37,
          "en": "wanna sort these places by distance to the user's location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "And for that I got this loc.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 29.37,
          "en": "which got all the functionalities and functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.37,
          "end": 30.843,
          "en": "to do that sorting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.43,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "In the end here, I'm simply calculating the distance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "between two positions on the world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.443,
          "en": "made up of latitude and longitude coordinates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "So this file is already there, but now in AvailablePlaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 48.33,
          "en": "I need to fetch the user's location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.33,
          "end": 51.317,
          "en": "before I set my AvailablePlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.29,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "And that's something we also did earlier in another section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 58.41,
          "en": "And I'll do it again here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "because we can fetch the location of a user in the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 67.05,
          "en": "by using the navigator object that's built into the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "So that's not provided by me or React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.12,
          "en": "Instead, this is coming from the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.12,
          "end": 77.12,
          "en": "And on this navigator object, there is a geolocation object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 80.523,
          "en": "which then has a getCurrentPosition method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "And you can call this method to get the current position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 86.16,
          "en": "of the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "Now get current position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 91.98,
          "en": "just like sending an HTTP request takes some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.98,
          "end": 95.67,
          "en": "The position is not available instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "and therefore getCurrentPosition works such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "that it takes a function which will be executed eventually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 105.57,
          "en": "by the browser in the future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 107.673,
          "en": "once the position has been fetched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "So here we can't use Async await",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "because getCurrentPosition does not yield a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "but here we're using this callback pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 121.02,
          "en": "to define the code that should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.02,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "once the position is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 126.81,
          "en": "And this function which will be executed by the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.81,
          "end": 128.22,
          "en": "once the data is there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.22,
          "end": 130.89,
          "en": "will then receive a position object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 133.413,
          "en": "that contains the user's coordinates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.28,
          "end": 136.92000000000002,
          "en": "And it's therefore now inside of this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "where I want to set my availablePlaces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 142.383,
          "en": "but I first want to sort them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.28,
          "end": 147.09,
          "en": "And to do that we can add a sortedPlaces constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.09,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "or variable which holds the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 152.893,
          "en": "of calling sortPlacesByDistance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 156.53199999999998,
          "en": "which is a function from that loc.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.53199999999998,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "which must therefore be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.633,
          "en": "in this AvailablePlaces.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "And with it imported, we can call it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 172.563,
          "en": "and pass our resData.places to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "We also must pass the user's latitude and longitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 181.83,
          "en": "coordinates to sortPlacesByDistance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.83,
          "end": 185.49,
          "en": "and we can get that out of the position object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.49,
          "end": 190.49,
          "en": "Here, it's position.corrds.latitude for the latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.65,
          "end": 194.94,
          "en": "and position.coords.longitude for the longitude.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.94,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "And it's now the sortedPlaces that I want set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 199.757,
          "en": "as my AvailablePlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.288,
          "end": 204.84,
          "en": "And my key point here is that I wanna show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 207.3,
          "en": "that of course you can work with that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.3,
          "end": 210.72,
          "en": "you are getting back in any way you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 214.633,
          "en": "and you can perform other long taking operations thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.633,
          "end": 219.63,
          "en": "and simply update your AvailablePlaces in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 220.983,
          "en": "once you are done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 225.18,
          "en": "But now here's something important to watch out for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.18,
          "end": 227.76,
          "en": "Since we're not using Async await here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.76,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "but instead this callback function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 234.57,
          "en": "we have to change the place where we call setIsFetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.57,
          "end": 235.953,
          "en": "and set it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 238.38,
          "en": "Because doing this down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.38,
          "end": 241.05,
          "en": "would set it to false too early.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 242.49,
          "en": "In the end, I also wanna wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 242.49,
          "end": 245.31,
          "en": "until we're done sorting and fetching that position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.31,
          "end": 248.07,
          "en": "And since we can't await this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.07,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "since this won't work here, we can't call setIsFething here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 255.45,
          "en": "because this code would now execute too early",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 255.45,
          "end": 260.01,
          "en": "because JavaScript will not wait with executing this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 260.01,
          "end": 262.623,
          "en": "until this callback function here is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 263.7,
          "end": 266.1,
          "en": "Instead, it will call this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 266.1,
          "end": 271.1,
          "en": "right after we initiate it, that position call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 272.43,
          "end": 275.97,
          "en": "And therefore now we should move setIsFetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 278.19,
          "en": "into this callback function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 278.19,
          "end": 280.92,
          "en": "after setting the AvailablePlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 280.92,
          "end": 283.47,
          "en": "And in addition, we should also call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 283.47,
          "end": 287.04,
          "en": "after setting the error if we have one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 287.04,
          "end": 289.05,
          "en": "so that we set isFetching to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.05,
          "end": 292.53,
          "en": "if we're done fetching and sorting our places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 292.53,
          "end": 294.543,
          "en": "or if we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 297.75,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.75,
          "end": 301.32,
          "en": "we see that once we load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.32,
          "end": 305.28,
          "en": "we're asked for permission to get the user's location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.28,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "and we see that loading text until we do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "And once I do that, it will start getting my location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 315.96,
          "en": "and we still see the loading text whilst that's happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 315.96,
          "end": 318.33,
          "en": "But then once the location has been fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 318.33,
          "end": 320.013,
          "en": "the places are displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 321.21,
          "end": 324.63,
          "en": "And if I reload the app now that I granted the permission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.63,
          "end": 325.8,
          "en": "this will happen quicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 325.8,
          "end": 327.9,
          "en": "But still it can take some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 327.9,
          "end": 329.973,
          "en": "until my location has been fetched.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}